                    Repeated to Karachi and London.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d73-f2" n="2" xml:id="d73-f2-content">
                <p><ref target="#d355">Document 355</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d73-f3" n="3" xml:id="d73-f3-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d355-f6">footnote 6, Document 355</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d73-f4" n="4" xml:id="d73-f4-content">
                <p>Bunker was scheduled to arrive in the
                    United States in early June for approximately 2 months of home leave and
                    consultations in Washington.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d73-f5" n="5" xml:id="d73-f5-content">
                <p>Dated May 15. (Department of State, Central Files, 791.13/5–1559)</p>
            </note>
